  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nCheck out our latest bundled collections \n\nCart\nSkip to product information\nOpen media 1 in modal\nOpen media 2 in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n4\n\nFABLE HOME\n\nDinnerware Set\nRegular price\n$236.00 CAD \nSale price\n$215.00 CADSale\nShipping calculated at checkout.\nQuantity\nDecrease quantity for Dinnerware Set\nIncrease quantity for Dinnerware Set\nAdd to cart\nBuy it now\n\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Fable.\n\nFrom breakfast cereal to an elaborate homemade pasta night, this bundle will help make every meal at home special. \n\n16 piece set includes Dinner Plates, Salad Plates, Pasta Bowls, and Breakfast Bowls.\n\nMaterials\nBundle Specs\nCare information\nShare\nWe design responsibly.\n\nWe intentionally design our pieces to transcend passing trends. We believe in durable items that will last for years—not only physically, but aesthetically—and we design products that are as timeless as they are stylized.\n\nAbout us\nDon't miss out\n\nSubscribe to our mailing list for insider news, product launches, and more.\n\nEmail\nGet to know Craft\nAbout\nMagazine\nOur mission\n\nWe create products that are as enjoyable as they are ethical.\n\nCountry/region\nCanada (CAD $)\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-craft-demo Powered by Shopify"
